      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source first.Now I'll write the improved test. The original has three issues worth fixing:\n1. All four assertion messages are identical and inaccurate (\"last character is &\" doesn't hold for `&#`, `&#x`, `&#X`)\n2. No explanation of what \"out of bounds\" means in context\n3. Repetitive structure that can be expressed more clearly with a parameterized testThe improved test compiled successfully."
